---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const {lang='ko'}=Astro.props;
const en=lang==='en';
---
<Base lang={lang} title={en ? 'About — Shinyook' : '소개 — Shinyook'}>
<article class="prose about">
 <h1>Shinyook Lee</h1>
 <p class="role">Software engineer · London, UK</p>
 <p>{en ? 'I’m a software engineer living in London. My wife and I moved here in September 2026.' : '런던에 살고 있는 소프트웨어 엔지니어입니다. 2026년 9월, 아내와 함께 영국으로 왔습니다.'}</p>
 <p>{en ? 'I write about development, things I’m learning, and everyday life in the UK.' : '개발하며 배운 것들과 공부한 내용, 영국에서의 일상을 기록합니다.'}</p>
 <div class="links"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shinyook-lee">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/shinyook">GitHub ↗</a></div>
 <section aria-labelledby="outside"><h2 id="outside">{en ? 'Outside of work' : '일 밖에서는'}</h2>
 <p>{en ? 'I enjoy running and take an interest in running shoes. I also like exploring ergonomic keyboards.' : '러닝을 좋아하고, 러닝화에 관심이 많습니다. 인체공학 키보드를 찾아보는 것도 좋아합니다.'}</p>
 </section>
</article>
</Base>
<style>
.about{margin-top:54px}.about h1{font-size:34px;margin-bottom:4px}.role{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:30px}.about>p{font-size:16px}.links{display:flex;gap:24px;margin:25px 0 48px;font-size:14px}.about section h2{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;margin:38px 0 22px}#outside+p{font-size:15px}@media(max-width:600px){.about{margin-top:38px}.about h1{font-size:30px}}
</style>
